            <p style="font-size: var(--text-regular); line-height: var(--text-body-line-height); margin: 0px; text-wrap: pretty;">Ideas and evidence that help the field reason about AI in education: research insights on the roles AI should (and shouldn’t) play in the classroom and methods for evaluating how well AI can play those roles.</p>
