            <p style="font-size: var(--text-regular); line-height: var(--text-body-line-height); margin: 0px; text-wrap: pretty;">Reusable infrastructure that future classroom tools can be built on, from validated AI capabilities to the datasets that power them. We build these to work across many subjects and types of schools.</p>
